Bug 1751's parser fix makes `type Row [3]int` parse, but named-array transparency at index/len is NOT implemented in IR-gen (pkg/binate/ir/gen_access.bn). genIndex/genIndexPtr/getIndexElemType and the len lowering check Typ.Kind == TYP_ARRAY directly, peeling only peelReadonly — never peelNamed — so a TYP_NAMED-over-TYP_ARRAY isn't recognized: `r[i]` emits an invalid LLVM bitcast (i64->ptr) and `len(r)` returns 0. Needs peelNamed at every index/len site. See claude-todo.md.
